{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:2127","original":"Kagamine Len is a Japanese [[VOCALOID]] developed and distributed by Crypton Future Media, Inc., and was originally released for the VOCALOID2 engine on December 27, 2007. He is the second of the Character Vocal Series together with [[Kagamine Rin]] and is an official [[Piapro Studio|PIAPRO]] character.\r\n\r\nHe has [[blonde hair]] done in a [[short ponytail]] and [[blue eyes]]. He wears a [[sailor collar]] shirt with [[bass clef]] print and [[necktie]]. He wears [[shorts]] along with [[detached sleeves]], [[leg warmers]] and a white [[headset]].\r\n\r\nHis counterpart is [[Kagamine Rin]]. Their relationship (whether they are [[siblings]], lovers, etc) is officially left ambiguous and left up to the user to decide.\r\n\r\nHe is voiced by [[Shimoda Asami]]. He was originally designed and illustrated by [[KEI (Keigarou)|]] for his V2 voicebank. His V4X voicebank follows a similar outfit with readjustments designed and illustrated by [[iXima]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #164844: VOCALOID2 [[kagamine len (act1)|Act1]]\r\n* !post #4921833: VOCALOID2 Act2\r\n* !post #804549: [[kagamine len (append)|Append]]\r\n* !post #2534193: [[kagamine len (vocaloid4)|Vocaloid4]]\r\n* !post #7936765: [[Kagamine Len (SP)|SUPER PACK]]\r\n* !post #9885325: [[Kagamine Len (NT)|NT]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Magical Mirai Len]]\r\n* [[Sakura Len]]\r\n* [[Yuki Len]]\r\n* [[Kagamine Len (voicebank)]]\r\n* [[List of VOCALOID derivatives]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Official page\":https://ec.crypton.co.jp/pages/prod/virtualsinger/cv02","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"kagamine_len"}],"evidence_chain":[{"e